      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Kang et al.",
        "AbstractText": "The complete genome sequence of the wild-type genotype 2B rubella virus RVi/Busan.KOR/10.15[2B], isolated from a patient in South Korea, was determined. The availability of this sequence will help in understanding the circulation of endemic rubella viruses, as well as their genetic diversity."
